T[8687]={"Reinforcements have been called on to join the assault on Hive'Zora. You have been selected to target Hive'Zora tunnelers. Report back to Commander Mar'alith after completing your task.","NULL"}
T[8689]={"I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, $N. I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, $c.$B$BI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course. I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.$B$BI promise you won't be disappointed.","Ah yes... this drape is immaculate.$B$BTake this cloak, $N. May it protect you from the foul magic of the Qiraji."}
