T[8756]={"","Rise, Qiraji Conqueror! Rise and be recognized!"}
T[8757]={"","Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.$b$bThe signet ring of the invoker will greatly enhance your magical and natural abilities.$b$bBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind."}
T[8758]={"","Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, $n. May you never stray from the path of the invoker!"}
