T[8823]={"","Excellent! It is no small sacrifice that you've made to earn these signets, and you will be acknowledged for your service appropriately. It's adventurers like you, $N, that truly make a difference.$B$BLet me know if you have additional signets to hand in; I'll gladly help you out with whatever ones you need exchanged."}
